eature normalization function (mirroring the Python training pipeline) prepares the features"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"An ONNX MLP (static signs) or Transformer (dynamic signs) classifies the sign"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"A rule-based layer provides per-finger interpretability and actionable tips"}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":22,"marginBottom":12,"marginTop":32},"children":"Accessibility"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--muted)","lineHeight":1.7},"children":"SignTutor targets WCAG 2.2 AA conformance. All interactive controls have keyboard navigation, visible focus rings, and ARIA labels. Webcam mirroring is on by default. Left-handed mode flips both the demo and recognition."}],["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":22,"marginBottom":12,"marginTop":32},"children":"Models"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--muted)","lineHeight":1.7},"children":"The current models are trained on synthetic landmark data. Recognition accuracy improves significantly with real signer data - the CI pipeline is already in place to gate regressions when real datasets are integrated."}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"marginTop":32,"display":"flex","gap":12,"flexWrap":"wrap"},"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/learn/asl/fingerspelling","style":{"background":"var(--accent)","color":"#0a0f24","padding":"10px 20px","borderRadius":8,"fontWeight":600,"textDecoration":"none"},"children":"Start learning"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/privacy","style":{"background":"var(--panel)","color":"var(--ink)","padding":"10px 20px","borderRadius":8,"fontWeight":600,"textDecoration":"none","border":"1px solid var(--line)"},"children":"Privacy policy"}]]}]]}]]}],[["$","script","script-0",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/0nwokv0..mnip.js","async":true}]],["$","$L3",null,{"children":["$","$4",null,{"name":"Next.MetadataOutlet","children":"$@5"}]}]]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"gJQJrVLEfVabarebCB9PJ"}
